<title>GERMANY: Munich air cargo up 13.7pct in Feb 97.</title>
<headline>Munich air cargo up 13.7pct in Feb 97.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo flown to and from Munich airport (MUC) grew 13.7 percent in February to 7,452 tonnes, Flughafen Muenchen GmbH said.</p>
<p>The following tables show 1997 details with all figures in tonnes and percentage changes on the same period 12 months ago.</p>
<p> Feb 1997	    Monthly total	Pct change</p>
<p> Total cargo	 7,452		   up 13.7</p>
<p> Exports	     3,402		   up 14.8</p>
<p> Imports	     3,345		   up 11.5</p>
<p> Transit		 705		   up 18.9</p>
<p> Jan-Feb 1997	Cumulative total    Pct change</p>
<p> Total cargo	 14,458		  up 18.0</p>
<p> Exports		6,592		  up 20.1</p>
<p> Imports		6,436		  up 13.2</p>
<p> Transit		1,430		  up 32.7</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Muenchen GmbH, traffic statistics dept.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
